WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:06.322
Astronaut in black shirt tends plants in illuminated panel, works near window with green plants.

2
00:00:11.379 --> 00:00:17.450
Astronaut moves right, interacts with wall equipment while plants visible behind glass.

3
00:00:22.678 --> 00:00:28.493
Astronaut reaches into lit plant growth chamber, handles green vegetation while anchored.

4
00:00:33.977 --> 00:00:38.879
Man in black shirt and blue gloves adjusts plants in brightly lit lab module.

5
00:00:45.275 --> 00:00:50.307
Man continues adjusting and caring for plants within the laboratory module.

6
00:00:56.574 --> 00:01:04.540
Astronaut in purple-lit plant chamber exits; person places red chili pepper on black surface labeled SWEET CHILI PEPPER.

7
00:01:32.723 --> 00:01:40.031
Two astronauts in blue and black shirts hold a small object; two additional astronauts enter; all six.
